WEBVTT

00:10:29.958 --> 00:10:32.711
as I grapple with this and other topics.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:41.178
So as we end this day, or tomorrow,
before you begin the next,

00:10:41.178 --> 00:10:42.888
sit down,

00:10:42.888 --> 00:10:44.181
take a breath,

00:10:44.181 --> 00:10:45.349
and reflect.

00:10:45.933 --> 00:10:48.936
And you'll see the power that this habit
brings to your life.

00:10:50.479 --> 00:10:51.647
Thank you.

00:10:51.689 --> 00:10:54.858
(Cheers and applause)